  "description": "A friendly, dependency-free Discord bot SDK for .NET 10. Build bots with plain C# methods and attributes: slash commands, checks and cooldowns, buttons, forms, polls, threads and events. Works with Native AOT.\n        Join our community on Discord: https://discord.gg/2KrUPCgh",
