  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.11.0: New attributes for checks and cooldowns, forms, events, command translation, and where commands work. Adds enum options, replying by returning a value, data in component IDs, confirmations and pagination, constructor injection, a generated help command, polls, threads and forum posts, layout messages (Components V2), message forwarding, member and message search, bulk bans and application emojis. Fixes entity parsing, DM and uncached-channel messages, gateway reconnect and resume, per-resource rate limits, command parameters and context menu commands. Sharding reworked: cluster traffic is now authenticated, so upgrade all nodes together. Distributed sharding is experimental. Includes behavior changes, so re-sync your commands and read the upgrade notes: https://github.com/Simple-DotNet/SimpleDiscordDotNet#v1110",
